        "text": "Alethia:(nods as she follows Brelyna) Yes, I believe I'd put it in one of the... many still-empty weapon display racks. (laughs softly as they walk) Speaking of, maybe we could continue the artifact organization spree we began last night before we got... distracted, when we return from Markarth? (pauses, thinking) Finally bring everything over from the Arch-Mage's quarters? (pauses) Well, except whatever we decide to deliberately leave there, anyway. (Talking to Brelyna Maryon)"
