        "text": "Alethia:(retrieves the staff from a nearby wardrobe) It really has become home, hasn't it? (pauses, then laughs softly) Even if I still have a certain fondness to the Arch-Mage's quarters. It's... nice, and I don't *just* say that due to the existence of the spa configuration. (laughs softly) (Talking to Brelyna Maryon)"
      },
